    "title": "也 / 得: 说什么/怎么着也得X: insist regardless of circumstances",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-insistence-p07-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "也 / 得: 说什么/怎么着也得X: insist regardless of circumstances",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "说什么/怎么着也得X insists that an action is necessary regardless of objections. It is stronger than a neutral statement of need.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我说什么也得去。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ shuō shénme yě děi qù 。",
                "meaning": "I must go no matter what.",
                "audio": "7e13aba0955359f60cae599d89b0aa882b98c2492163483d62edb363759a513f"
              },
              {
                "text": "说什么也得试一下。",
                "pinyin": "shuō shénme yě děi shì yīxià 。",
                "meaning": "We have to try, whatever happens.",
                "audio": "d6de74edff56a5512777547522d4015ae726a52b63fe2cb99857acd26dd28da7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
